{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/c02.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/c02.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "c02_bottom_02",
      "hash64": "8EB27C6306A38949",
      "text": "多虧有摩托蜥，\\n我們才能越過烘烘沙漠啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "c02_bottom_03",
      "hash64": "8EB27B6306A38796",
      "text": "得用寶可夢洗澡澡\\n好好幫牠把沙子清乾淨才是呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "c02_bottom_08",
      "hash64": "8EB2826306A3937B",
      "text": "我希望牠一直都是瑪力露，\\n所以當牠快要進化時……\\c\\n我就會用「Ｂ鍵取消進化！」\\n這個幸運咒語喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "c02_bottom_16",
      "hash64": "8EAF0E6306A09888",
      "text": "玻瓶市的對戰場\\n與河川是相連的呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "c02_bottom_18",
      "hash64": "8EAF0C6306A09522",
      "text": "想到上面去的話，\\n就在升降機前面等著吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "c02_bottom_19",
      "hash64": "8EAF0D6306A096D5",
      "text": "再往前去河水就要變深囉！\\n要是會用衝浪的話，就可以放心了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "c02_bottom_20",
      "hash64": "8EAB8E63069D8931",
      "text": "漬沁鎮位於沙漠的另一端！\\n如果打算去那裡的話，千萬要好好準備。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "c02_bottom_31",
      "hash64": "8EA88963069B4ADB",
      "text": "有種帶著硬幣的小寶可夢！\\n我一靠近之後，牠就掉下硬幣\\r\\n然後消失不見了！那是什麼啊！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "c02_bottom_40",
      "hash64": "8EC0126306AF1287",
      "text": "要不要幫在家裡等著的寶可夢\\n買些什麼回去呢～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "c02_bottom_41",
      "hash64": "8EC0116306AF10D4",
      "text": "我喜歡的食物\\n和寶可夢喜歡的食物，\\r\\n為什麼有點不一樣呢～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "c02_bottom_53",
      "hash64": "8EBC8B6306ABF74B",
      "text": "這座城市的牆壁就像是瀑布耶！\\n用來練習攀瀑是再適合不過了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "c02_bottom_54",
      "hash64": "8EBC906306ABFFCA",
      "text": "我是從穴扎鎮來的，\\n所以這裡的水量真是讓我嚇了一大跳！\\r\\n畢竟在那邊，水是很珍貴的啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "c02_bottom_60",
      "hash64": "8EB9866306A9B8F5",
      "text": "瑪力露是水屬性！\\n所以牠果然是很喜歡水喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "c02_bottom_70",
      "hash64": "8EB6006306A69F6C",
      "text": "傷腦筋不知道該吃什麼時，\\n不知不覺就會到來來來軒這兒呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "c02_center_01",
      "hash64": "8BE972D3CE7158DA",
      "text": "這裡是讓坐騎寶可夢\\n稍微休息的地方。\\c\\n騎著牠們東奔西跑之後，\\n也要好好表達感謝之意才是。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "c02_center_02",
      "hash64": "8BE971D3CE715727",
      "text": "玻瓶市是個水鄉澤國！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳看了就知道囉～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "c02_center_14",
      "hash64": "8BE5E9D3CE6E3A38",
      "text": "這座城市裡的餐廳\\n評價很高呢！\\c\\n因為用的幾乎都是漬沁鎮產的\\n新鮮素材啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "c02_center_29",
      "hash64": "8BEFE6D3CE7689A4",
      "text": "我要趁著年輕到處去旅行，\\n拍很～多照片。\\c\\n然後等我變成老奶奶時，\\n我要看著那些照片回想這一切。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "c02_center_45",
      "hash64": "8BDBDED3CE65D302",
      "text": "這地方有名的店是\\n海岱俱樂部啊～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "c02_center_46",
      "hash64": "8BDBDDD3CE65D14F",
      "text": "我想去上面那家三明治店啦～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "c02_center_50",
      "hash64": "8BD855D3CE62B460",
      "text": "我實在很不會看地圖。\\n……北邊是哪邊呀？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "c02_center_51",
      "hash64": "8BD856D3CE62B613",
      "text": "地圖App上綠色的方位就是北邊喔。\\n如果會迷路的話，何不把地圖固定呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "c02_center_68",
      "hash64": "8BE25FD3CE6B19E3",
      "text": "玻瓶是配合懸崖建造的城市！\\n所以市內是一層一層喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "c02_center_98",
      "hash64": "8C00E5D3CE84FB24",
      "text": "哎呀～真是大買特買了一番！\\n接下來要去哪裡？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "c02_center_99",
      "hash64": "8C00E6D3CE84FCD7",
      "text": "再來就是去漬沁鎮的市場\\n從第一攤買到最後一攤！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "c02_center_111",
      "hash64": "25F757E7C55B09B2",
      "text": "這裡是水鄉澤國玻瓶～♪\\n什麼是玻瓶～就是裝水的玻璃瓶～♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "c02_center_118",
      "hash64": "25F760E7C55B18FD",
      "text": "在建設升降機之前，\\n聽說在城裡上上下下移動\\r\\n都是靠坐騎寶可夢呢！好辛苦啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "c02_center_127",
      "hash64": "25FAE1E7C55E2A07",
      "text": "聽說只有優秀的人才能擁有\\n能讓寶可夢太晶化的太晶珠呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "c02_center_128",
      "hash64": "25FAD6E7C55E1756",
      "text": "據說寶可夢只有在\\n帕底亞地區才會太晶化。\\r\\n這究竟是為什麼呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "c02_center_143",
      "hash64": "25E65DE7C54CA0B1",
      "text": "在那一般人不能進去的\\n帕底亞巨坑裡，\\r\\n會有什麼樣的寶可夢呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "c02_center_151",
      "hash64": "25E9DFE7C54FB36E",
      "text": "歡迎光臨海岱俱樂部！\\n這裡是道館館主海岱的店喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "c02_center_165",
      "hash64": "25ED63E7C552C991",
      "text": "玻瓶市美麗的街景\\n是很受歡迎的拍照景點呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "c02_center_169",
      "hash64": "25ED5FE7C552C2C5",
      "text": "我們明年開始就要上學了耶！\\n不知道能不能交到很多朋友？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "c02_center_170",
      "hash64": "25F0CCE7C555B1D3",
      "text": "我好期待宿舍生活喔！住宿舍的話，\\n在睡覺前吃點心也不會挨罵，對不對？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "c02_top_01",
      "hash64": "56607CDC064C158A",
      "text": "在把整座城市的色調改成藍色之後，\\n這裡就增加了不少觀光客。\\c\\n聽說這個點子是幾年前\\n由海岱先生提出來的喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "c02_top_07",
      "hash64": "566076DC064C0B58",
      "text": "一吃順口二吃上癮，三明治就吃夾飽堡♪\\n來買一份三明治吧～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "c02_top_22",
      "hash64": "56676BDC06521755",
      "text": "玻瓶道館的道館測驗\\n非～常難呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "c02_top_23",
      "hash64": "56676ADC065215A2",
      "text": "海岱先生是這座城市的招牌喔！\\n他總是又開朗又體貼，而且\\r\\n當他在當道館館主時簡直帥爆了呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "c02_top_31",
      "hash64": "5663E4DC064EFC19",
      "text": "雖然在地形起伏激烈的\\n帕底亞沒辦法做到，\\r\\n但我真想試試騎腳踏車旅行。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "c02_top_32",
      "hash64": "5663E1DC064EF700",
      "text": "聽說在其他地區有摩托蜥之外的\\n坐騎寶可夢。不知道是真是假～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "c02_top_36",
      "hash64": "5663E5DC064EFDCC",
      "text": "這個月我很努力……\\n所以可以買個高級包包吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "c02_top_38",
      "hash64": "5663EBDC064F07FE",
      "text": "換個髮型，心情煥然一新！\\n你說呢？是不是很可愛？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "c02_top_39",
      "hash64": "5663ECDC064F09B1",
      "text": "呃……\\n妳是剪了瀏海嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
